+# Handicap Info Legend Notes
+
+## Goodies Footnote
+
+> (*): This element is listed under the heading **"Goodies (20)"** in the XML file.
+> It indicates the chance (x-in-20) of a goody hut yielding this result when "popped" by the player.
+> Source: [Civ4 Difficulty Wiki](https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/Difficulty_level_(Civ4)?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
+
+## Abbreviation Keys
+
+- **AIFT_**: `AIFreeTechs`
+- **FT_**: `FreeTechs`

